{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"const assetPathPrefix = \"https://www.figma.com/api/mcp/asset/a48c8359-8583-4285-9a5b-4447eea36285\";\nconst img = `${assetPathPrefix}/aa629.svg`;\nconst img1 = `${assetPathPrefix}/c4e1e.svg`;\nconst img2 = `${assetPathPrefix}/eb441.svg`;\nconst imgEllipse9 = `${assetPathPrefix}/5c616.svg`;\nconst imgEvaPersonFill = `${assetPathPrefix}/bc604.svg`;\nconst imgEvaPersonFill1 = `${assetPathPrefix}/1b285.svg`;\nconst imgClaritySettingsSolid = `${assetPathPrefix}/f7cee.svg`;\nconst imgVector = `${assetPathPrefix}/2f6e7.svg`;\nconst imgGroup = `${assetPathPrefix}/cdb5f.svg`;\nconst imgVector1 = `${assetPathPrefix}/1aa37.svg`;\nconst imgVector2 = `${assetPathPrefix}/40c2b.svg`;\nconst imgEllipse11 = `${assetPathPrefix}/f3b20.svg`;\n\nfunction NavProfile({ className }: { className?: string }) {\n  return (\n    <div className={className || \"bg-white h-[60px] relative w-[390px]\"} data-node-id=\"336:807\" data-name=\"САДОХОД / nav / profile\">\n      <div className=\"absolute left-[52.5px] size-[27px] top-[16.5px]\" data-node-id=\"336:808\" data-name=\"Магазины\">\n        <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={img} />\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"absolute left-[169.5px] size-[27px] top-[16.5px]\" data-node-id=\"336:813\" data-name=\"Камера\">\n        <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={img1} />\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"absolute left-[286.5px] size-[27px] top-[16.5px]\" data-node-id=\"336:816\" data-name=\"Профиль\">\n        <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={img2} />\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default function Component01() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"bg-[#f0efeb] relative size-full\" data-node-id=\"366:15805\" data-name=\"01 · Профиль\">\n      <div className=\"-translate-x-1/2 absolute bg-[#48352d] h-[150px] left-1/2 rounded-[10px] top-[39px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"366:15819\" />\n      <div className=\"-translate-x-1/2 absolute left-[calc(50%+0.5px)] size-[93px] top-[127px]\" data-node-id=\"366:15820\">\n        <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={imgEllipse9} />\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"-translate-x-1/2 absolute left-1/2 size-[60px] top-[143px]\" data-node-id=\"366:15821\" data-name=\"eva:person-fill\">\n        <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={imgEvaPersonFill} />\n      </div>\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Bold'] leading-[normal] left-[calc(50%-37px)] not-italic text-[12px] text-black top-[235px] tracking-[-0.24px] whitespace-nowrap\" data-node-id=\"366:15823\">\n        martini felesk\n      </p>\n      <a className=\"absolute contents cursor-pointer left-[24px] top-[297px]\" data-node-id=\"366:15824\">\n        <div className=\"absolute left-[24px] size-[34.621px] top-[297px]\" data-node-id=\"366:15825\" data-name=\"eva:person-fill\">\n          <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={imgEvaPersonFill1} />\n        </div>\n        <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[75.16px] not-italic text-[#2c1b15] text-[14px] top-[306px] whitespace-nowrap\" data-node-id=\"366:15827\">\n          профиль\n        </p>\n      </a>\n      <div className=\"absolute contents left-[30px] top-[437.44px]\" data-node-id=\"366:15828\">\n        <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[74.44px] not-italic text-[#2c1b15] text-[14px] top-[441.44px] whitespace-nowrap\" data-node-id=\"366:15829\">\n          настройки\n        </p>\n        <div className=\"absolute left-[30px] size-[24.211px] top-[437.44px]\" data-node-id=\"366:15830\" data-name=\"clarity:settings-solid\">\n          <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={imgClaritySettingsSolid} />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"absolute contents left-[31px] top-[351.62px]\" data-node-id=\"366:15833\">\n        <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[74.41px] not-italic text-[#2c1b15] text-[14px] top-[354.62px] whitespace-nowrap\" data-node-id=\"366:15834\">\n          поддержка\n        </p>\n        <div className=\"absolute inset-[50.23%_86.8%_46.84%_7.95%]\" data-node-id=\"366:15835\" data-name=\"Vector\">\n          <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={imgVector} />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"absolute contents left-[31px] top-[481.65px]\" data-node-id=\"366:15836\">\n        <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[74.03px] not-italic text-[#2c1b15] text-[14px] top-[485.65px] whitespace-nowrap\" data-node-id=\"366:15837\">\n          навигация\n        </p>\n        <div className=\"absolute inset-[68.81%_87.09%_27.8%_7.95%]\" data-node-id=\"366:15838\" data-name=\"Group\">\n          <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={imgGroup} />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"absolute contents left-[29px] top-[525.42px]\" data-node-id=\"366:15842\">\n        <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[74.44px] not-italic text-[#2c1b15] text-[14px] top-[525.42px] whitespace-nowrap\" data-node-id=\"366:15843\">\n          сотрудничество\n        </p>\n        <div className=\"absolute inset-[75.06%_86.13%_22.61%_7.44%]\" data-node-id=\"366:15844\" data-name=\"Vector\">\n          <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={imgVector1} />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <NavProfile className=\"absolute bg-white h-[60px] left-0 top-[640px] w-[390px]\" />\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] h-[60px] left-[8px] top-[640px] w-[110px]\" data-node-id=\"366:15847\" data-name=\"NAV / Магазины\" />\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] h-[60px] left-[125px] top-[640px] w-[110px]\" data-node-id=\"366:15848\" data-name=\"NAV / Камера\" />\n      <div className=\"absolute contents left-[31px] top-[392.12px]\" data-node-id=\"366:15849\">\n        <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[74.03px] not-italic text-[#2c1b15] text-[14px] top-[397.12px] whitespace-nowrap\" data-node-id=\"366:15850\">\n          уведомления\n        </p>\n        <div className=\"absolute contents left-[31px] top-[392.12px]\" data-node-id=\"366:15851\">\n          <div className=\"absolute inset-[56.71%_86.8%_40.37%_7.95%]\" data-node-id=\"366:15852\" data-name=\"Vector\">\n            <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={imgVector2} />\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"absolute left-[40.65px] size-[12.058px] top-[392.12px]\" data-node-id=\"366:15853\">\n            <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={imgEllipse11} />\n          </div>\n          <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Bold'] leading-[normal] left-[44.77px] not-italic text-[7.235px] text-white top-[394.69px] whitespace-nowrap\" data-node-id=\"366:15854\">\n            1\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <a className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] block cursor-pointer h-[60px] left-0 top-[640px] w-[130px]\" data-node-id=\"379:420\" data-name=\"FLOW / Низ / Магазин\" />\n      <a className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] block cursor-pointer h-[60px] left-[130px] top-[640px] w-[130px]\" data-node-id=\"379:422\" data-name=\"FLOW / Низ / Камера\" />\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] h-[60px] left-[260px] top-[640px] w-[130px]\" data-node-id=\"379:424\" data-name=\"FLOW / Низ / Профиль\" />\n    </div>\n  );\n}"},{"type":"text","text":"SUPER CRITICAL: The generated React+Tailwind code MUST be converted to match the target project's technology stack and styling system.\n1. Analyze the target codebase to identify: technology stack, styling approach, component patterns, and design tokens\n2. Convert React syntax to the target framework/library\n3. Transform all Tailwind classes to the target styling system while preserving exact visual design\n4. Follow the project's existing patterns and conventions\nDO NOT install any Tailwind as a dependency unless the user instructs you to do so.\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Node ids have been added to the code as data attributes, e.g. `data-node-id=\"1:2\"`."},{"type":"text","text":"These styles are contained in the design: brown: #48352D, gray 5: #D9D9D9, dark brown: #2C1B15, black: #000000, test: #AB0216, white: #FFFFFF, beige: #F0EFEB."},{"type":"text","text":"The generated code contains image and SVG URL constants, e.g. const image = `${assetPathPrefix}/<asset file name>`, where assetPathPrefix is declared once at the top of the code and every asset URL interpolates it. These URLs are temporary download sources and expire after 7 days. Download each asset into the project with curl -L, then replace its URL in the generated code with a reference to the downloaded asset. Never use the temporary URLs as runtime image sources."},{"type":"image","data":"","mimeType":"image/png"}],"structuredContent":null,"isError":false}
